- `Build Tool` &rarr; `inventory/build/<tool>.md` (Required headings: `# Build Configuration`, `# Artifacts`)
- `Configuration` &rarr; `inventory/configs/<file>.md` (Required headings: `# Configuration Schema`, `# Environment Variables`)
{{else if (eq agentName "arch-mapper")}}
