- `Data Flow` &rarr; `architecture/flows/<name>.md` (Required headings: `# Sequence Lifecycle`, `# Flow Diagram`)
- `Architecture Decision` &rarr; `architecture/decisions/<id>.md` (Required headings: `# Context`, `# Decision`, `# Consequences`)
{{else if (eq agentName "code-inspector")}}
